JOWVKWPVEYNET6IPVPE53JYU","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://diariocorreo.pe/edicion/ica/nasca-cuatro-policias-heridos-deja-brutal-choque-frontal-entre-patrullero-y-trailer-noticia/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"\" title=\"https://diariocorreo.pe/edicion/ica/nasca-cuatro-policias-heridos-deja-brutal-choque-frontal-entre-patrullero-y-trailer-noticia/\"><b>Un accidente de tránsito entre un automóvil rojo de placa Y1T-263</b></a><b> y una camioneta de la Policía Nacional del Perú, perteneciente al servicio de Carreteras de Humay, dejó personas heridas, entre ellas un menor de edad que estaría con heridas graves y fue trasladada al Hospital San Juan de Dios de Pisco. El hecho se registró </b><a href=\"https://diariocorreo.pe/edicion/ica/ica-auto-conducido-por-policia-ebrio-sube-a-la-vereda-y-arrolla-a-joven-madre-causandole-fractura-de-craneo-noticia/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"\" title=\"https://diariocorreo.pe/edicion/ica/ica-auto-conducido-por-policia-ebrio-sube-a-la-vereda-y-arrolla-a-joven-madre-causandole-fractura-de-craneo-noticia/\"><b>en la carretera Los Libertadores Wari, a la altura del cementerio del distrito de Independencia.</b></a>"},{"level":2,"_id":"RRQIUAIDFJATPDRECGOTXBZ7GQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<b>Brutal choque</b>"},{"_id":"URF5VOXFQJCCDEJVFJX6Z7VTYE","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Según las primeras informaciones, tras la violenta colisión, transportistas y ciudadanos que se encontraban por la zona acudieron a auxiliar a los ocupantes de los vehículos involucrados. Entre ellos se encontraba el menor, quien fue evacuado para recibir atención médica debido a la gravedad de sus lesiones."},{"_id":"NKCMAB24FRHDHJDOLRRY424IUY","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"El accidente generó preocupación entre los conductores y pobladores que transitaban por esta importante vía de comunicación. El choque entre el vehículo particular y la unidad policial dejó severos daños materiales."},{"_id":"XFTEIDTM75HYPOVUNY72HZNR4I","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Asimismo, se reportó la intervención de un ciudadano que habría auxiliado al menor durante la emergencia."},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"18b380fe2f9d1890df61f8d2607427ef4c0d302ba5f8d8daef42f5561c47911e"},"caption":"","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/N3CXAXDBSRFV3JANKMU3XAFXQM.png","licensable":false,"credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"ICA","width":1274,"_id":"N3CXAXDBSRFV3JANKMU3XAFXQM","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/N3CXAXDBSRFV3JANKMU3XAFXQM.png?auth=18b380fe2f9d1890df61f8d2607427ef4c0d302ba5f8d8daef42f5561c47911e","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/N3CXAXDBSRFV3JANKMU3XAFXQM.png?auth=18b380fe2f9d1890df61f8d2607427ef4c0d302ba5f8d8daef42f5561c47911e","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/N3CXAXDBSRFV3JANKMU3XAFXQM.png","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/N3CXAXDBSRFV3JANKMU3XAFXQM.png?auth=18b380fe2f9d1890df61f8d2607427ef4c0d302ba5f8d8daef42f5561c47911e","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/N3CXAXDBSRFV3JANKMU3XAFXQM.png?auth=18b380fe2f9d1890df61f8d2607427ef4c0d302ba5f8d8daef42f5561c47911e&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"accidente 2000.png","mime_type":"image/png","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-24T04:47:26Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-24T04:47:26Z","height":646,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"864610c3e1efd997cbdd0e3eb2fda15a9ca11730bb2de77db6aa742ce485dce4"},"caption":"","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/DW4DR3RKL5HNDH2Z4P2XOVORDU.jpg","licensable":false,"credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"ICA","width":1121,"_id":"DW4DR3RKL5HNDH2Z4P2XOVORDU","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/DW4DR3RKL5HNDH2Z4P2XOVORDU.jpg?auth=864610c3e1efd997cbdd0e3eb2fda15a9ca11730bb2de77db6aa742ce485dce4","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/DW4DR3RKL5HNDH2Z4P2XOVORDU.jpg?auth=864610c3e1efd997cbdd0e3eb2fda15a9ca11730bb2de77db6aa742ce485dce4","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/DW4DR3RKL5HNDH2Z4P2XOVORDU.jpg","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/DW4DR3RKL5HNDH2Z4P2XOVORDU.jpg?auth=864610c3e1efd997cbdd0e3eb2fda15a9ca11730bb2de77db6aa742ce485dce4","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/DW4DR3RKL5HNDH2Z4P2XOVORDU.jpg?auth=864610c3e1efd997cbdd0e3eb2fda15a9ca11730bb2de77db6aa742ce485dce4&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"3.1 JPG.jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-24T04:47:26Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-24T04:47:26Z","height":623,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"_id":"Q4WYFQNN3RGRZH46KYM3FAUFAY","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<b>📲 Únete al canal oficial de Diario Correo en WhatsApp y recibe en tu celular las noticias más importantes del Perú y el mundo, alertas de último minuto y las portadas del día, todo de forma rápida y confiable. No te quedes fuera de la información.</b>"},{"_id":"CC6DR5VM75AB3E6L52GZMEAQDY","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<b>Súmate aquí: 👉 </b><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb7TiRS9cDDcPrLTPY0z/\" rel=\"\" title=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb7TiRS9cDDcPrLTPY0z\"><b>https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb7TiRS9cDDcPrL